        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 0600, 12 Inch Extension Flush Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFlush bolts (also known as door edge bolts) are installed into the edge of the door and have a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer). This locks or unlocks an inactive door. The Solid Brass 12 Inch Flush Bolt comes complete with flush bolt assembly, matching finish screws, strike plate and bolt guide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf measuring an existing Extension Flush bolt for replacement: Measure from the \"Flip Lever\" to the \"Door Bolt Head\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin 0600 12 Inch Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: .875\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2.25\" </li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: .937\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: .93\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <b>No Returns.</b></i>\r\n</p>",
